OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fthrough the morning and early
OL,8,Fafternoon. Rain turning more showery
OL,9,Flater through the afternoon but
OL,10,Fremaining heavy at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy in the evening
OL,13,Fand overnight with fresh northwest
OL,14,Fwinds and showery outbreaks of rain. A
OL,15,Ffew clearer spells possible towards
OL,16,FOrkney.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
