OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FVariable cloud and bright
OL,6,Fspells with a few showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, becoming dry and bright
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon. Outbreaks of
OL,9,Frain, some heavy, spread east in the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FBreezy with occasionally heavy rain or
OL,14,Fshowers on Thursday. Bright spells and
OL,15,Fshowers on Friday rain spreading east
OL,16,Flater. Bright spells and blustery
OL,17,Fshowers on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
